                <p>Not printed; the memorandum under reference from Edwin M. Martin, Special Assistant to the Secretary of State for
                    Mutual Security Affairs, to Maj. Gen. George
                        Olmsted of the Office of Military Assistance in the Department of
                    Defense, Aug. 6, is in Department of State file 791.5 MSP/7–152.</p>
            </note>
